 "name_en": "Service – Intercompany Execution (7GC)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Service – Intercompany Execution (7GC)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio056d446f8ab24601ac9a07c730227d69\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio056d446f8ab24601ac9a07c730227d69__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">An intercompany service order is a business transaction used to distribute a service between two companies with different company codes that belong to the same organization. In the context of this scope item, we refer to the company managing the contractual agreement with the service customer as the \"selling company\" and the company performing the service as the \"executing company\".</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Intercompany services are subject to specific accounting considerations. It's crucial for companies to allocate and account for the costs and revenues associated with these services accurately. This helps in ensuring proper financial reporting, internal cost allocation, and compliance with tax regulations.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio056d446f8ab24601ac9a07c730227d69__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\" id=\"loio056d446f8ab24601ac9a07c730227d69__ul_sf1_pmv_mbc\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create service order with intercompany service item in the \"selling company\".</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create service order in \"executing company\".</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Service confirmation in \"executing company\".</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Service billing and invoicing from \"executing company\" towards \"selling company\".</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Service billing and invoicing towards customer (considering intercompany invoice).</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio056d446f8ab24601ac9a07c730227d69__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\" id=\"loio056d446f8ab24601ac9a07c730227d69__ul_bgq_qmv_mbc\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Ability to perform parts of the service or the entire service in one or more other companies of the same organization.</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Accurate cost and revenue posting in all involved companies.</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">One invoice to the customer from the contract holding company.</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>服务 - 公司间执行 (7GC)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio056d446f8ab24601ac9a07c730227d69\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio056d446f8ab24601ac9a07c730227d69__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">公司间服务订单是一种业务交易，用于在属于同一组织的具有不同公司代码的两个公司之间分配服务。在此范围项目的上下文中，我们将与服务客户签订合同协议的公司称为“销售公司”，将执行服务的公司称为“执行公司”。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">公司间服务受特定会计注意事项的约束。对于公司而言，准确分配和说明与这些服务相关的成本和收入至关重要。这有助于确保正确的财务报表、内部成本分配以及遵守税务法规。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio056d446f8ab24601ac9a07c730227d69__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\" id=\"loio056d446f8ab24601ac9a07c730227d69__ul_sf1_pmv_mbc\">\n       <li class=\"li\">在“销售公司”中创建含公司间服务项目的服务订单。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">在“执行公司”中创建服务订单。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">“执行公司”中的服务确认。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">从“执行公司”到“销售公司”的服务开票和开发票。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">针对客户的服务开票和开发票（考虑公司间发票）。</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio056d446f8ab24601ac9a07c730227d69__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\" id=\"loio056d446f8ab24601ac9a07c730227d69__ul_bgq_qmv_mbc\">\n       <li class=\"li\">在同一组织的一个或多个其他公司中，能够执行部分服务或整个服务。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">所有相关公司的准确成本和收入过账。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">合同控股公司向客户开具的一张发票。</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
